as they are.**nae**To: wilbieRe:   StrikeCc: redsext, sargon, shadowmonk, nae, bobo, nunu, turbo, tinman, thumper, akira, nylakoorubDate: Mar 27jesus christ, this is such crap. i'm sorry, i try to stay out of politics, but tatsuo hasmanaged to brainwash people. so here's the deal, as faras i'm concerned.i'm gonna keep doing what i'm doing. coding, enjoying themud. it's a GAME!!!!!!! i have fun here.if you want to leave, then be my guest... *shurg* buta strike??? WHO FUCKING CARES????jesus, maybe i shouldnt mail when i'm drunk. but this is justsuch crap... whining about shit that tatsuo obviously has no clue about.wilbie, and whoever else supports this strike... i have a suggestion forya- go on strike. turn off your machine, get out into the world,and realize that there's more to it than this game. causethis game doesnt mean a damn thing.nae**nylakoorub**To: naeSubj:  What your Month!Date: Mar 27Hey, Nae...   Don't take the lords in vain... ok..All I want to see is New blood in the Arch positions, I don'tcare if it not meall though I am was promised a chance at it and was ignored**tinman**To: naeSubj: guildDate: Mar 27okay it should load the file properly now.  I foundout that we had to mvoe it to the lower level inorder for it to work.Tinman**nae**To: nylakoorubSubj: timelordsCc: naeDate: Mar 28> No...   Timelords name is reserved for the Timelord Clan> if the clan system is still in place and going to be usednow, let me get this straight. you didnt want me changinganything in the guild, yet when i go ahead and use existingnames for things, you get upset, saying i'm not allowed to.seems to me that since that is used in the guild already,perhaps YOU should be the one to get a new name?*shrug*  just an observation...nae**nylakoorub**To: naeSubj: re: timelordsDate: Mar 29Timelords was never a org. colossus thing... it was an idea of somethinguniuq for the guildI was going to remov